  },
  {
    "id": 3023008010030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～\r\n朝のテレビでやってるやつとかは見ますけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302300801/3023008010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3023008010040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "同じ星座とか血液型の人がみんな同じ運勢なのか\r\nって思うとあんまり信じないかな～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302300801/3023008010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "ああ、それはそうかも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 3023008010050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ま、雛菜が１位だったりしたら\r\nそうだよね～！　って思いますけど",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302300801/3023008010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "あはは、\r\n自分に都合がいいのだけ信じるパターンね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 3023008010060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nそうですね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302300801/3023008010060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
